1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,130
Reuters: hackers breached the US Air Force's Cloud One platform

2
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:08,370
It pools cloud from Microsoft, Amazon, Oracle and Alphabet

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:11,330
It holds personnel records, payroll, logistics

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,090
and air defence radar data

5
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:16,330
It tracks munitions at more than 200 Air Force locations

6
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:19,670
Who did it, and whether data was stolen, is unclear

7
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:22,910
One source says hackers exploited a software vulnerability

8
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,910
Cyber Command was reportedly called in, and

9
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:25,890
migrations are suspended

10
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:29,370
Would your government trust one shared cloud platform now?
